OL,3,GNEWSAMan in hospital after second
OL,4,Aincident on Glasgow road inside 24
OL,5,Ahours
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man is being treated in hospital
OL,8,Fafter a crash on the same Glasgow road
OL,9,Fwhere six pedestrians were injured when
OL,10,Fa car mounted a pavement on Tuesday.
OL,12,FOfficers closed Hyndland Road in the
OL,13,Fwest end of the city on Wednesday at
OL,14,Fabout 16:50, following a report of
OL,15,Fconcern for a person who was involved
OL,16,Fin a single-vehicle crash.
OL,18,FPolice Scotland said the man, the sole
OL,19,Foccupant of the vehicle, was taken to
OL,20,Fhospital for treatment, where he
OL,21,Fremains. The road re-opened about
OL,22,F22:00.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
