OL,3,GNEWSAMan in hospital after second
OL,4,Aincident on Glasgow road inside 24
OL,5,Ahours
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt came just 24 hours after a car
OL,8,Fmounted the pavement on the same road,
OL,9,Fhitting a bus stop and scaffolding
OL,10,Fbefore coming to a halt.
